:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Ryu (Enemy)]].''
'''Ryu''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]] gains [[Strengthen]] and increases [[Savage Blow]] chance.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 511
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Ryu
|name2 = Ryu CC
|name3 = Kage
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ryu CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Kage''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Much like [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder God Zeus]], Ryu is a good generalist against all enemies due to his high range and health. However, unlike Zeus, he has a rapid attack rate, being able to attack without the risk of being knocked back, even if the damage is low. His damage is accentuated further with his Savage Blow. While low at 15%, his fast attack rate makes up for it.

==='''True Form'''===
Kage has a slightly longer attack animation, but his effective DPS winds up the same because of his increased Savage Blow Chance. He also geins the ability to Strengthen by 50% at 40% health, making his potential DPS higher than even [[EVA Unit-01 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit 01]]'s in his own strengthen. A Strengthened Savage Blow would do 36,720 damage at level 30, with around 5,808.81 DPS assuming average luck. Keep in mind even with the better chance of Savage Blow, it's still luck-based if it occurs or not, so it's better to boost him with [[Catseye]]s if you wish to make him your generalist [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|uber]].

